translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_c36b411f:

    # "Children hurried around, throwing snowballs at their friends, parents watched and chatted amongst themselves from afar."
    "孩子们跑来跑去，朝朋友扔雪球，父母们在远处观看聊天。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:167
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_be8b2752:

    # "One merchant with huge mead barrels opened, poured patrons small cups who huddled together and laughed to themselves merrily."
    "一个商人打开巨大的蜂蜜酒桶，给挤在一起欢笑的顾客们倒上小杯。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:168
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_3d1b9cdc:

    # "For a brief moment in time, it was as though everyone forgot about the wars existence outside these city walls..."
    "在那一刻，仿佛所有人都忘记了城墙外战争的存在..."

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:169
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_da28cac1:

    # ADARA @ smile "Isn't it nice to see everyone out and so cheery?"
    ADARA @ smile "看到大家都出来这么开心，不是很好吗？"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:170
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_684e7350:

    # MC @ think "The last time it was like this was when-"
    MC @ think "上次这样还是——"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:171
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_db480df9:

    # "I pushed the thought of the Terminus ceremony to the ceremony to the back of my mind."
    "我把关于终结仪式的想法抛到脑后。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:172
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_1833ec0b:

    # "This was a happy time."
    "这是个快乐的时刻。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:173
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_681613ed:

    # ADARA @ smile "Look at this place! Isn't it wonderful?"
    ADARA @ smile "看看这地方！不是很棒吗？"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:174
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_8c941941:

    # "I smiled as the children chasing each other with snowballs hurried out in front of us."
    "我看着孩子们互相追逐扔雪球，匆匆跑过我们面前，露出了微笑。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:175
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_99be07bb:

    # MC @ smile2 "Yes, it's nice."
    MC @ smile2 "是的，很好。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:176
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_149e2884:

    # ADARA @ joy "What should we do now?"
    ADARA @ joy "我们现在该做什么？"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:180
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_664cc199:

    # "The time went by quickly as we had fun, it was always easy letting time drift by with 阿达拉."
    "我们玩得很开心，时间过得很快，和阿达拉在一起时时间总是过得特别快。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:182
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_c8fe2941:

    # MAD_PROPHET "GATHER! GATHER ALL!"
    MAD_PROPHET "集合！大家都集合！"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:188
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_397e2913:

    # ADARA @ shock "Isn't he cold wearing so little in this weather?"
    ADARA @ shock "这种天气穿这么少他不冷吗？"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:189
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_58374c5f:

    # MAD_PROPHET "Come and hear the tale of Krishana the ice dragon!"
    MAD_PROPHET "来听听冰龙克里莎娜的故事吧！"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:190
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_5506bc64:

    # ADARA @ smile "What do you think? Wanna listen?"
    ADARA @ smile "你觉得呢？想听听吗？"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:197
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_53aaa9a4:

    # "The two of us stepped closer and joined the growing crowd, mainly comprised of children but a few adults lingered."
    "我们俩走近加入越来越多的人群，主要是孩子，但也有几个大人逗留着。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:198
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_8b9e7ec0:

    # MAD_PROPHET "And so we begin, centuries long past, Krishana, the great ice dragon, sat on her ice throne in the mountains of Angmurus!"
    MAD_PROPHET "故事开始于几个世纪前，伟大的冰龙克里莎娜坐在安格穆鲁斯山脉的冰王座上！"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:199
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_7a95d963:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}Bored!{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}无聊！{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:200
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_e98b016a:

    # "The crowd laughed a little."
    "人群发出轻笑。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:201
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_b6989b01:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}'I know!'{/i} Thought the mighty dragon, {i}'I shall see what the humans down south are up to!'{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}'我知道了！'{/i} 强大的龙想着，{i}'我要去看看南方的人类在干什么！'{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:202
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_e6c8eed8:

    # MAD_PROPHET "As her mighty wings soared, she headed down south, perching herself up on a small mountain, watching the villagers down below!"
    MAD_PROPHET "她展开强大的翅膀向南飞去，栖息在一座小山上，观察着下面的村民！"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:203
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_5452de45:

    # MAD_PROPHET "The people revered but feared the mighty dragons! And each parent warned the children not to approach the great Krishana!"
    MAD_PROPHET "人们敬畏强大的龙！每个父母都警告孩子不要接近伟大的克里莎娜！"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:204
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_bf4a2f15:

    # MAD_PROPHET "Some young children, brave and adventurous, ignoring their parents advice, scaled the small mountain and approached the dragoness!"
    MAD_PROPHET "一些勇敢爱冒险的小孩不顾父母警告，爬上山接近了龙女！"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:205
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_7e9a0589:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}'But what brings you small humans here?'{/i} The dragoness asked!"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}'但你们这些小小人类为何来此？'{/i} 龙女问道！"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:206
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_aa79a142:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}'Oh great Krishana! It has not snowed in these lands for so long! Can you not make it so?{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}'哦伟大的克里莎娜！这片土地很久没下雪了！您能让它下雪吗？{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:207
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_5fa83f8d:

    # MAD_PROPHET "The dragon laughed, and laughed and laughed!"
    MAD_PROPHET "龙大笑起来，笑个不停！"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:208
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_7ecbd013:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}But what in return shall thy give thee?{/i} The dragoness asked."
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}但你们能给我什么回报呢？{/i} 龙女问道。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:209
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_1a3da702:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}For my hordes of gold are vast, and I never suffer hunger long!{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}因为我的黄金堆积如山，也从不会长久挨饿！{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:210
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_ef09375e:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}What could you possibly have to offer me?{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}你们能给我什么呢？{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:211
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_8f1a64cc:

    # MAD_PROPHET "The children looked amongst themselves for a moment, till one stepped forward and offered the great Krishana a small stone."
    MAD_PROPHET "孩子们互相看了一会儿，直到一个孩子上前递给伟大的克里莎娜一块小石头。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:212
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_70d2ab96:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}But what is this?{/i} The dragoness asked."
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}但这是什么？{/i} 龙女问道。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:213
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_d33e7b2d:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}It is a waystone!{/i} the child answered!"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}这是路标石！{/i} 孩子回答！"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:214
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_60db9f86:

    # MAD_PROPHET "{i}So no matter where you fly, you will always be able to find your way home here!{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "{i}这样无论您飞到哪里，都能找到回家的路！{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:215
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_9e7dd2b0:

    # MAD_PROPHET "Krishana took the small gift, and boomed, {i}'HOME? HERE? FOR ME?'{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "克里莎娜接过小礼物，大声说：{i}'家？这里？给我？'{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:216
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_0229275b:

    # MAD_PROPHET "The dragoness, so touched by the gift, said with a cool blow of air, {i}I've never had a home before.{/i}"
    MAD_PROPHET "龙女被礼物深深打动，呼出一口凉气说：{i}我从未有过家。{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:217
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_2bb02a72:

    # MAD_PROPHET "Before the children could answer, the mighty Kirshana unleashed her icy breath into the sky, and the children celebrated as the snow fell down!"
    MAD_PROPHET "孩子们还没来得及回答，强大的克里莎娜向天空呼出冰息，孩子们欢呼着看雪花飘落！"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:218
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_dda3abaf:

    # MAD_PROPHET "And so it was, Krishana returned every year to bring forth the snow in exchange for the children's gifts!"
    MAD_PROPHET "从此以后，克里莎娜每年都会带来雪花，换取孩子们的礼物！"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:219
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_9885251b:

    # MAD_PROPHET "And thus, that is why yearly we share gifts amongst loved ones and friends! To celebrate this most joyous of times!"
    MAD_PROPHET "因此，我们每年都会与亲友互赠礼物！庆祝这最欢乐的时刻！"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:220
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_c64f40ac:

    # "The crowd clapped and handed over some coins towards the man, who collected them in a small jar."
    "人群鼓掌并向男子递上硬币，他把钱收进一个小罐子。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:225
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_29f9f809:

    # ADARA @ smile "Krishana was always one of my favorite stories growing up."
    ADARA @ smile "克里莎娜的故事一直是我成长中最喜欢的之一。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:226
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_51eae6f2:

