    "{i}拉蒙不过这个节日，但我想这对你很重要，所以送上我的礼物，我的爱人——爱你的，妮嘉。窝的书写有进步吗？{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:802
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_ce363925:

    # "A note was hastily attached to a shiny, ruby encrusted ring that seemed to radiate some kind of light energy."
    "一张便条匆忙地系在一枚闪闪发光、镶有红宝石的戒指上，戒指似乎散发着某种光明的能量。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:803
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_109711fa:

    # "{i}Look, just because you're an adventurer dear, doesn't mean you're excused from being unfashionable, hope this helps - yours truly, D.{/i}"
    "{i}听着，亲爱的，就算你是冒险者，也不代表你可以不修边幅，希望这个能帮上忙——你真诚的，D.{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:806
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_ae8ca6ba:

    # "The real question is, how did they know it would fit perfectly?"
    "真正的问题是，他们怎么知道尺寸会如此完美？"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:810
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_d5c7648c:

    # "俄蕾娜 approached me with a book in her mouth."
    "俄蕾娜叼着一本书向我走来。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:815
