    # ELENA "BARK!"
    ELENA "汪！"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:824
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_e872ca60:

    # "俄蕾娜 moved to curl up in a ball and waited patiently for Erika to leave."
    "俄蕾娜蜷成一团，耐心地等待艾丽卡离开。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:828
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_829f966b:

    # "A letter with extremely poor writing was resting on top of a small jar of what seemed like ... slime?"
    "一封字迹歪歪扭扭的信放在一个小罐子上，罐子里似乎是...粘液？"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:829
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_ffa0ad38:

    # "{i}MYU WISH HAPHY DAY, PHLES USE WHEN MYU NO HERE- LOVE MYU{/i}"
    "{i}米尤祝尼快咯日，尼不在这时请用——爱尼的米尤{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:830
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_b9980011:

    # "Looking towards the small jar, as I picked it up in my hand immediately, the slime inside reacted slightly, and seemed to be pouring out of the glass towards me."
    "看向小罐子，我刚一拿起它，里面的粘液就微微蠕动起来，仿佛要流出玻璃罐涌向我。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:831
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_d400f042:

    # "Realizing it {i}was{/i} a part of 米尤, I could sense arousal radiating from the jar."
    "意识到这{i}就是{/i}米尤的一部分，我能感觉到罐子里散发出情欲的气息。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:832
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_85b6db6a:

    # MC "(I think she wants me to... let it out when I'm turned on perhaps?)"
    MC "(我想她是想让我...在兴奋的时候把它放出来？)"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:836
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_24e17665:

    # MC @ talk "Coming now!"
    MC @ talk "这就来！"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:844
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_e6ac4c58:

    # "For just a few hours, we were together, we were happy, and the war and all of its horrors seemed so very far away."
    "仅仅这几个小时，我们团聚在一起，我们很快乐，战争及其所有恐怖似乎都那么遥远。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:845
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_54157c65:

    # "I think I know that these days can't last forever, some terrible darkness I can feel draws ever closer, and the endless battles and wars still rage on outside."
    "我深知这样的日子无法永恒，我能感觉到某种可怕的黑暗正步步逼近，而无休止的战斗与战争仍在外面肆虐。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:846
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_e9195ccb:

    # "I somehow know, I will end up caught in the crosswinds of it's blaze."
    "我冥冥中知道，自己终将被卷入这场烈焰的乱流之中。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:847
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_391c37b3:

    # "I knew, there were more battles to come."
    "我知道，前方还有更多的战斗。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:849
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_540147d8:

    # "...But what the hell's the point of spending your life fighting if you just end up alone in the end?"
    "...但如果最终只剩孤独一人，那耗尽一生去战斗又他妈的有什么意义？"

