# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:119
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_regina_dialogue_menu_763dcf1e:

    # "Humming to herself, Regina headed out the door, waving the two of us goodbye as she closed the door shut behind herself."
    "蕾吉娜自言自语地哼着歌走向门口，关上门时向我们两人挥手道别。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:789
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_693fe49d:

    # "A letter was attached, and with it was one, beautiful amulet radiating some kind of magecraft."
    "附有一封信，以及一个美丽的护身符，散发着某种魔法。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:791
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_9f2b68b0:

    # "I stared down at the amulet, such a thing would normally be reserved for only those of much higher esteem than myself."
    "我低头凝视着护身符，这样的东西通常只会留给那些比我地位高得多的人。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:792
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_ef2cf4b1:

    # "I felt the maddening encroach of my infection slow even just holding it to inspect..."
    "甚至只是拿着它检查，我就感觉到那令人发狂的感染侵蚀速度减缓了……"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:798
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_85c5c414:

    # "The food looked delicious, and even though it was now a little cold, no doubt I could eat it in the morning."
    "食物看起来很好吃，尽管现在有点凉了，无疑我可以在早上吃。"

# game/data/world_events/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:805
translate zh ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_78754af7:

    # "My thoughts lingered towards the elven shopkeeper, and I smirked at the thought of Dros no doubt carefully picking out the right ring for me."
    "我的思绪停留在那位精灵店主身上，想到德罗斯无疑在仔细为我挑选合适的戒指，我不禁笑了起来。"
